{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1708340,
  "courseSlug": "learn-flutter-dart-to-build-ios-android-apps",
  "courseTitle": "Flutter & Dart - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37145114",
      "title": "Configuring Implicit Animations",
      "lectureOrder": 205,
      "videoOrder": 189,
      "sourceHash": "3487d4a63f385947a47bc3b25ef3813be1e90366dc0f0e222470d9dd8548be37",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.3,
          "en": "And with that finally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.3,
          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "we got all the setup we need to animate this icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 10.32,
          "en": "And of course here I still took some time to explain this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.32,
          "end": 13.11,
          "en": "so it took us some time to build this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.11,
          "end": 14.58,
          "en": "But of course that's the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.58,
          "end": 16.65,
          "en": "because you're currently learning it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.65,
          "end": 19.83,
          "en": "If you take a look at this code, it should be easy to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.83,
          "end": 23.49,
          "en": "that this is much less code than you had to write",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.49,
          "end": 25.95,
          "en": "with the explicit animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "And that's why implicit animations often",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 30.33,
          "en": "are the better choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.33,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "Now with that, let's save it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "and let's see whether it works though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 36.9,
          "en": "If I go back here to a meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.9,
          "end": 39.93,
          "en": "and I click this star, huh,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.93,
          "end": 43.05,
          "en": "still nothing happens here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.05,
          "end": 46.23,
          "en": "And the reason for that is that at the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 48.42,
          "en": "with this code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.42,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "Flutter can't really detect whether anything changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 58.02,
          "en": "because sure, I am swapping the icon data inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.02,
          "end": 61.74,
          "en": "of my icon, but it's technically still a icon widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.74,
          "end": 66.57,
          "en": "and therefore an icon element that is visible on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.57,
          "end": 69,
          "en": "and Flutter therefore doesn't see any difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "It doesn't explore the detailed data stored in this icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 75.96000000000001,
          "en": "it just see that it was an icon widget before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.96000000000001,
          "end": 78.393,
          "en": "and that it's now still an icon widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.47,
          "end": 84.03,
          "en": "So to make sure that Flutter is aware of this change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.03,
          "end": 87.87,
          "en": "we should add a key to our icon here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.87,
          "end": 90.39,
          "en": "And you learned about keys earlier in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.39,
          "end": 94.2,
          "en": "They are always useful if you need to differentiate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.2,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "between two widgets that are of the same type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 99.99000000000001,
          "en": "but got different data attached to them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.99000000000001,
          "end": 101.85,
          "en": "And here we must add a key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.85,
          "end": 104.49000000000001,
          "en": "because the AnimatedSwitcher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.49000000000001,
          "end": 107.00999999999999,
          "en": "will take that key into account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.00999999999999,
          "end": 111.03,
          "en": "to find out if we technically have a different widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.03,
          "end": 114.15299999999999,
          "en": "than before, even though the type might be the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.53,
          "end": 118.97999999999999,
          "en": "And the key I will add here is a value key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.97999999999999,
          "end": 121.44,
          "en": "which is isFavorite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.44,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "and therefore it will indeed change between true and false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 128.58,
          "en": "And Flutter will therefore see that something changed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.58,
          "end": 130.923,
          "en": "and will then trigger this animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.45,
          "end": 135.87,
          "en": "So now with the key added here, if we restart this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.87,
          "end": 140.87,
          "en": "and go here, now we see an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.94,
          "end": 143.91,
          "en": "And of course here we got a pretty wild animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.91,
          "end": 146.34,
          "en": "because we're using the default animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.34,
          "end": 150.93,
          "en": "between zero and one as a turns value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 154.26,
          "en": "So we're in the end giving this star a full turn here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.26,
          "end": 156.69,
          "en": "which looks rather wild.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.69,
          "end": 157.71,
          "en": "To change this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.71,
          "end": 160.68,
          "en": "if we're not happy with this kind of animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.68,
          "end": 165.21,
          "en": "we could replace the animation we pass as a value to turns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.21,
          "end": 168.54,
          "en": "with a tween about which you also learned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.54,
          "end": 170.67000000000002,
          "en": "and which you can also use in the context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.67000000000002,
          "end": 172.92000000000002,
          "en": "of implicit animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.92000000000002,
          "end": 175.26,
          "en": "because the whole idea behind a tween",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.26,
          "end": 178.95,
          "en": "really just is that it gives you more control over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.95,
          "end": 182.013,
          "en": "between which values you wanna animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.12,
          "end": 186.24,
          "en": "And here we could then, for example, create a tween",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.24,
          "end": 190.86,
          "en": "where we wanna begin at 0.5 and end at one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.86,
          "end": 193.38,
          "en": "And then again, Flutter would take care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.38,
          "end": 196.89,
          "en": "of translating its animation between zero and one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.89,
          "end": 200.523,
          "en": "to an animation between 0.5 and one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 203.79,
          "en": "You now just have to call animate here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.79,
          "end": 206.07,
          "en": "because otherwise you just got a tween.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.07,
          "end": 208.29,
          "en": "And what you actually need is an animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.29,
          "end": 210.993,
          "en": "and animate returns such an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 212.34,
          "end": 214.68,
          "en": "Now, animate then needs a parent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.68,
          "end": 217.41,
          "en": "and previously that was the animation controller,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.41,
          "end": 219.45,
          "en": "but in the end, a animation controller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.45,
          "end": 222,
          "en": "is just a animation configuration object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222,
          "end": 224.49,
          "en": "And the same is true for this animation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.49,
          "end": 227.13,
          "en": "So you can simply pass this animation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.13,
          "end": 228.993,
          "en": "as a value to animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.43,
          "end": 233.79,
          "en": "Now, the only remaining problem here is that by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.79,
          "end": 238.35,
          "en": "Dart infers this to be an animation of type num.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.35,
          "end": 242.94,
          "en": "So a mixed set of numbers, doubles and integers mixed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 242.94,
          "end": 247.2,
          "en": "And one way of working around this is to set this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.2,
          "end": 250.86,
          "en": "to a double by using 1.0 instead of one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.86,
          "end": 254.34,
          "en": "because otherwise this is inferred as an integer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 254.34,
          "end": 257.94,
          "en": "An alternative would be to take advantage of the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 257.94,
          "end": 260.67,
          "en": "that tween is actually a generic type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.67,
          "end": 262.95,
          "en": "and by explicitly telling it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262.95,
          "end": 265.593,
          "en": "that the values should be treated as doubles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 266.88,
          "end": 268.65,
          "en": "So either approach works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 268.65,
          "end": 271.5,
          "en": "but with that, we now changed the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 271.5,
          "end": 274.53,
          "en": "between which Flutter will play an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 274.53,
          "end": 277.32,
          "en": "And if we do that, we will therefore see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 277.32,
          "end": 280.08,
          "en": "that now this is a bit less wild,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.08,
          "end": 282.69,
          "en": "and of course you can still change this a bit more,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 282.69,
          "end": 286.59000000000003,
          "en": "and, for example, animate between 0.8 and 1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 286.59000000000003,
          "end": 289.323,
          "en": "to reduce this effect even more.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 290.43,
          "end": 291.51,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 291.51,
          "end": 294.18,
          "en": "It's really up to you what you wanna animate here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 294.18,
          "end": 297.24,
          "en": "But with that, I think this looks quite nice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 297.24,
          "end": 300.15,
          "en": "and this is how you can add an implicit animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 300.15,
          "end": 302.64,
          "en": "simply by using AnimatedSwitcher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 302.64,
          "end": 305.37,
          "en": "or one of the many other animated widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 305.37,
          "end": 306.663,
          "en": "provided by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 308.16,
          "end": 311.79,
          "en": "The difference between those widgets and AnimatedSwitcher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 311.79,
          "end": 315.09,
          "en": "in the end mostly is that AnimatedSwitcher only cares",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.09,
          "end": 318.54,
          "en": "about the fact that you're transitioning between two values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.54,
          "end": 322.11,
          "en": "and then you get full control over how to transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 322.11,
          "end": 325.56,
          "en": "whereas most of these other widgets are already focused",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.56,
          "end": 329.34,
          "en": "on one specific kind of animation that will be played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 329.34,
          "end": 333.36,
          "en": "For example, AnimatedCrossFade, which will simply fade",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 333.36,
          "end": 336.84000000000003,
          "en": "between two different widgets instead of allowing you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 336.84000000000003,
          "end": 340.02,
          "en": "to decide which transition should be played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 340.02,
          "end": 342.54,
          "en": "As always, it is simply best if you do dive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 342.54,
          "end": 344.61,
          "en": "into the documentation here as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 344.61,
          "end": 347.793,
          "en": "and you simply play around with these different widgets.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
